      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swanville%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Just west of Swanville, the Swan River winds northward before turning east toward the Mississippi near Little Falls.",
